[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/ShadowBolt.cs" id="1"]

; Shadow Bolt, the third combination (scripts/ShadowBolt.cs, .ai/combo-spells.md section 7): one node in the
; arena at its origin that carries the bolt's leaps, the festering curse and Pandemic's beat. No sprite and no
; collision shape: the leaps and the cave-ins measure their own reach against EnemyRegistry.Snapshot, and what
; is drawn is what hits. Until 2026-11-07 this scene was the ordinary chain spell (an Area2D on
; ChainLightning.cs); the conversion is in-flight item 17.
;
; BoltShare, CollapseShare, CollapseReachShare, FesterSpread and MaxCursed are the combination's own
; multipliers on its parents' numbers. Section 7's first guesses: 0.75, 0.5, 0.55, 2, 24.
[node name="ShadowBolt" type="Node2D"]
script = ExtResource("1")
BoltShare = 0.75
CollapseShare = 0.5
CollapseReachShare = 0.55
FesterSpread = 2
MaxCursed = 24
